# Context allowlist for platform/gateway/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# The context is the directory holding platform/ and subnet/.
*
!platform/deploy/workspace/pyproject.toml
!platform/deploy/workspace/uv.lock
!platform/gateway
!subnet/protocol
!subnet/worker/pyproject.toml

platform/gateway/tests
platform/gateway/Dockerfile*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/data
**/.env
